# CrisPRO Landing Page — Content Architecture

> Master reference for all landing page copy, design tokens, and build instructions.
> Every section maps 1:1 to a route or scroll beat in the production site.

---

## 1. DESIGN SYSTEM

### 1.1 Aesthetic
Dark. Clinical. Precise. War room meets research paper.
Not a startup. Not a hospital. The place where the receipts live.

### 1.2 Typography
| Role        | Font             | Weight | Notes                                        |
|-------------|------------------|--------|----------------------------------------------|
| Headlines   | Inter / Space Grotesk | 800    | Wide tracking, uppercase                   |
| Data/Numbers| JetBrains Mono   | 400    | Monospace — feels like a terminal, like evidence |
| Body        | Inter             | 400    | Clean, no personality, lets the numbers talk  |

### 1.3 Color Palette
| Token       | Hex       | Usage                                        |
|-------------|-----------|----------------------------------------------|
| Background  | `#0A0A0F` | Near-black, barely blue                      |
| Surface     | `#111118` | Card/panel surfaces                          |
| Accent      | `#00E5FF` | Electric cyan — numbers and receipt tags ONLY |
| Text        | `#E8E8F0` | Off-white, never pure white                  |
| Danger/Kill | `#FF4040` | "Trial failed" callouts ONLY                 |
| Success     | `#00D97E` | "CrisPRO scored it" callouts ONLY            |

### 1.4 Motion Rules
- Numbers count up on scroll entry (0 → target in 800ms).
- Proof cards: `RECEIPT VERIFIED` stamp animates in after card settles.
- Trial failure table rows: staggered 120ms entry.
- **Nothing bounces. Nothing fades ease-in-out. Everything snaps or counts. Precision.**

