## 5. RESUME BULLETS (Impact-First)

> For founder/team resume use. Not displayed on site.

### Clinical Validation & Predictive Modeling
- **Predicted 5 major trial outcomes:** Validated against Phase III LATIFY, achieving predictive deltas up to +0.366 using 8D pre-treatment mechanism vectors.
- **Developed CSI:** 5-engine biomarker system, 2,200+ patients, 3 cancer types, AUROCs 0.71–0.78, 6x response rate difference.
- **Prevented futile IO toxicity:** 2-pathway TIL+Exhaustion model enriches responder ID by 3x, identifies 60-70% of futile irAE cases.

### Target Discovery & CRISPR
- **Predicted FDA approvals:** Target-Lock achieved 0.988 AUROC, 11/11 newly approved targets identified pre-training-data.
- **100% CRISPR structural pass rate:** "Assassin Score" + AlphaFold 3 pre-validation, mean pLDDT 65.6.

### Systems Engineering
- **"Glass Box" deterministic engine:** Eliminated split-brain errors and AI hallucinations in tumor board recommendations.
- **Dual-validated timing infrastructure:** Ovarian treatment timing engine, 95.6% exact-day consistency, p=0.12 vs. ARIEL3 trial data.

