## 7. BUILD ORDER (Agent Instructions)

1. Set up the dark design system (`#0A0A0F` bg, Inter, JetBrains Mono, cyan accent).
2. Build the `NumberCounter` component (count-up on scroll entry) — used on every proof beat.
3. Build the two-row Layer 1/2 table with staggered row reveal.
4. Build the three case file cards (`/proof`) — `RECEIPT VERIFIED` stamp is the signature visual.
5. Wire the four-engine stack (`/platform`).
6. Contact form last.

> **You are building credibility, not excitement.** Credibility is built with specificity. Every vague sentence is a trust deficit. Every number with a receipt is a trust deposit.